The hard parts (policy engine, Ed25519 token verification, approval queue, evidence ledger) are in the monorepo at https://github.com/sint-ai/sint-protocol. The `@sint/gate-policy-gateway` package is the relevant dependency — ~200 lines to wire up as an Eliza plugin.

